<%= render "audit_log/shared/nav" %>
<h1><%= @record_type %> #<%= @record_id %></h1>
<p class="note">
  Full history for one record — the only screen where an unbounded range is acceptable,
  because a single record has bounded history. Paged by keyset, so there is no cap and
  no truncation. Index: <code>(record_type, record_id, occurred_at DESC)</code>.
</p>
<%= render "audit_log/shared/change_rows", changes: @changes %>
<%= render "audit_log/shared/pagination", pagy: @pagy, rows: @changes %>
